      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are vector fields on $\\mathbb R^3?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $U(x,y)=\\langle 4x, x^2, 1\\rangle$\n- **II.** $D(x,y)=\\langle 4x, x^2, 1\\rangle$\n- **III.** $J(x,y,z)=\\langle 4x, x^2, 1\\rangle$",
